# Inbox Zero Email Sync Architecture

**Core System**: Fetch Gmail/Outlook messages → Transform & Store locally (SQLite/PostgreSQL)

---

## 🎯 Executive Summary

This document covers the complete email synchronization pipeline in the Inbox Zero application, from initial fetch through local storage, plus a minimal self-hosted deployment guide focused on Gmail-only operation with AI helpers.

**Key Components:**
- 📥 Provider-agnostic email fetching (Gmail/Outlook)
- 🔄 Bidirectional pagination (forward/backward sync)
- 💾 Prisma-based local storage with deduplication
- 🤖 Optional AI utilities (summarization, drafting, persona)
- ⚙️ Minimal deployment strategy (drop queue/analytics/billing)

