### 5. Database Schema

**File**: `apps/web/prisma/schema.prisma`

model EmailMessage {
  id              String   @id @default(cuid())
  createdAt       DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt       DateTime @updatedAt
  threadId        String
  messageId       String
  date            DateTime      // Email sent/received timestamp
  from            String
  fromName        String?
  fromDomain      String
  to              String
  unsubscribeLink String?
  read            Boolean
  sent            Boolean
  draft           Boolean
  inbox           Boolean

  emailAccountId  String
  emailAccount    EmailAccount @relation(fields: [emailAccountId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([emailAccountId, threadId, messageId])  // Idempotency
  @@index([emailAccountId, threadId])
  @@index([emailAccountId, date])
  @@index([emailAccountId, from])
}

**Design Principles:**
- **Unique constraint**: Prevents duplicate inserts
- **Indexes**: Optimize common queries (date range, sender, thread)
- **Cascade delete**: Auto-cleanup when account removed

