### Token Management

// OAuth refresh handled automatically
const client = await getGmailClientForEmail({ emailAccountId });
// Client includes valid access token (auto-refreshed)

**Best Practices:**
- Tokens stored encrypted in database
- Refresh before each API call
- Cascade delete on account removal

### Rate Limiting

const PAGE_SIZE = 20;      // Conservative page size
const MAX_PAGES = 50;      // Hard stop at 1000 messages

**Strategy:**
- Respect Gmail quotas (10k calls/day typical)
- Exponential backoff on 429 errors (provider-specific)
- Incremental sync (not full re-sync)

